{"id":"vod_bf_43957","vodId":"43957","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"月色真美","name_cn":"月色真美","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-45/5bfe1e6320fc38567866a1ffd89519e4.jpg"},"summary":"安昙小太郎（千叶翔也 配音）出生在一个传统的日本家庭之中，个性细腻而又温厚的他自幼喜欢读书，暗中希望能够成为一名作家，总而言之是班级中并不起眼的存在。水野茜（小原好美 配音）是田径部的种子选手，个性开朗活泼全身上下散发着积极的光芒。这样性格迥异的两人，其生命轨迹被命运推动着联系到了一起。　　成熟稳重，可靠正直的比良拓海（田丸笃志 配音）、温柔坦诚，深受朋友们喜爱的西尾千夏（村川梨衣 配音）、严格谨慎，对男生敬而远之的泷泽葵（白石晴香 配音）、古灵精怪，令人捉摸不透的山科浪漫（笔村荣心 配音），在洋溢着青春气息的校园之中，属于他们的乐章正在谱写。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:11:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuesezhenmei/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuesezhenmei/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuesezhenmei/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuesezhenmei/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuesezhenmei/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuesezhenmei/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuesezhenmei/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuesezhenmei/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuesezhenmei/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuesezhenmei/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuesezhenmei/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuesezhenmei/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuesezhenmei/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/yuesezhenmei/第14集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32: